sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant F as React SPA (LoginForm)
  participant A as Express /api/auth
  participant M as authMiddleware
  participant DB as MongoDB Atlas

  U->>F: email + password
  F->>F: client-side validation (express-style rules)
  F->>A: POST /api/auth/login
  A->>DB: find user by email
  DB-->>A: user doc
  A->>A: bcrypt.compare(password, hash)
  alt invalid credentials
    A-->>F: 401 Unauthorized
    F-->>U: "Sign In Failed" alert
  else valid
    A->>A: generateToken(user._id) — JWT signed (JWT_SECRET)
    A-->>F: 200 { user fields, token }
    F->>F: localStorage['user'] = response
    F->>F: navigate to intended route or /
  end
  Note over F,A: subsequent API calls attach Authorization: Bearer <token>
  F->>A: GET /api/submissions/feed (Bearer token)
  A->>M: protect — verify JWT, load req.user
  M-->>A: authenticated user
  A-->>F: 200 feed payload
